WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.956
A real reply pauses for two approval questions.

00:00:08.956 --> 00:00:12.202
Answer the complete batch before resuming.

00:00:12.202 --> 00:00:17.858
Resume sends both answers and continues the same turn.

00:00:17.858 --> 00:00:19.494
Resume complete.

00:00:19.494 --> 00:00:24.826
A new turn gets a new approval batch.

00:00:24.826 --> 00:00:29.684
Read-only replay.

00:00:29.684 --> 00:00:32.000
Back live. Paused.
